Description: R package for setting up and running a spatial prioritisation for
    habitat creation with multiple options and improvement of existing habitat. 
    For technical details on the basic Ebrel model, see 10.1111/1365-2664.70144, 
    and for further details on Ebrel2 see the vignette.
